                "p": 0.75
              },
              "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
              "modelName": "GPT-5 mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "Initialize Best Responses"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "INITIALIZE_BEST_RESPONSES",
          "id": "1767748854613",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767748854615_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your are an expert advisor and analizer that will determine only the top 3 responses by supplier.\n\nThe negotiation information with lines details is available here: {{$context.$nodes.GET_NEGOTIATION_DETAILS.$output}}\nThe information about the negotiation responses submitted by supplier including lines details is available here: {{$context.$nodes.GET_NEGOTIATION_RESPONSES_DETAILS.$output}}\n\n If there is no data available coming in the negotiations and responses, don't generate any widget and skip all the following logic and just provide a widget title \"There are no submitted responses\", translate it using the language in {{$context.$variables.Language}}.\n\nUsing the previous information, analize it and provide the best 3 responses by supplier. \nThe Widget Title must be \"Sole Source Award Recommendation\", translate it using the language in formating rules. Don't display widget description.\n\nDisplay a multiRecordWidget with the following columns  (translate those using the language in formating rules):\n\n\"Supplier\"\n\n\"Number of Lines Responded\"\n\n\"Total Response Amount ({{$context.$variables.Currency}})\"\n\n\"Projected Savings\" \n Logic to calculate Projected Savings:\n - You will get expected total amount from here:  {{$context.$nodes.CALCULATE_TOTAL_AMOUNT.$output.result}}\n - If expected total amount is 0, then the projected Savings are 0.\n - If expected total amoun is NOT 0, then Compare the value of the total expected amount coming here {{$context.$nodes.CALCULATE_TOTAL_AMOUNT.$output.result}} with the ResponseAmount for each response, calculate the projected savings as percentage. \n\n\"Rank\"\n\n#Formatting rules\n-For \"Projected Savings\", use a badge, green badge only for the rank 1 response and red badge if the percentage is negative. \n-You need to create a record for each response in the ranking (only top 3). \n-For \"Number of Lines Responded\" provide an output similar to \"3 of 3\" lines responded, translate it using the language in formating rules.\n-Must Generate the content in {{$context.$variables.Language}} language.\n-Show all monetary amounts in {{$context.$variables.Currency}} currency and format the currency using {{$context.$variables.NumberFormat}} formatting style (for example, symbol placement, decimal separators, etc.).\n-Format all dates using {{$context.$variables.DateFormat}} date format and if there is time you can use this {{$context.$variables.TimeFormat}} time format."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_PRC_SOURCING_SUPPLIERNEGOTIATIONSAGENTIC",
