          "code": "INITIALIZE_ACTIONS",
          "id": "1767814398877",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767814398879_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Using the negotiation status code coming here: {{$context.$nodes.SUPPLIER_NEGOTIATION_DETAILS.$output.NegotiationStatusCode}} \n\nOnly if the negotiation status code is CLOSED generate an actionable insight using following the options: \n  title:\"Apply Sole Source Award\", translate it using the language in formating rules.\n  followUpCommand:  ora.Invoke(applySoleSourceAward,applySoleSourceAward-{{$context.$variables.AuctionHeaderId}}).\n  actionText must be \"Award Best Response\", translate it using the language in formating rules.\n  shortDescription that describes the sole source award to the best response will be applied.\n  PRIORITIZE this action. \n\nIf the negotiation status code is not CLOSED, don't generate anything.\n\n#Formatting Rules For Output\n -Must Generate the content in {{$context.$variables.Language}} language.\n -Show all monetary amounts in {{$context.$variables.Currency}} currency and format the currency using {{$context.$variables.NumberFormat}} formatting style (for example, symbol placement, decimal separators, etc.).\n -Format all dates using {{$context.$variables.DateFormat}} date format and if there is time you can use this {{$context.$variables.TimeFormat}} time format."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Get Invoke Action",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "const action = $context.$variables.AppAction;\n\nreturn action==\"InvokeAction\" ? \"InvokeAction\" : \"Other\";"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767880693541"
          },
