              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your are an expert advisor and analizer that will determine the top 1 response by supplier.\n\nThe negotiation information with lines details is available here: {{$context.$nodes.NEGOTIATION_DETAILS_FOR_AWARD.$output}}\nThe information about the negotiation responses submitted by supplier including lines details is available here: {{$context.$nodes.NEGOTIATION_RESPONSES_FOR_AWARD.$output}} \n\nUsing the previous information, analize it and provide the best response. Don't provide any output about this.\n\nYour output must follow this JSON object and you need to replace the ResponseNumber with the best response:\n\n{\n  \"awardSupplierResponses\": [\n    {\n      \"ResponseNumber\": \"<ResponseNumber>\",\n      \"AwardInternalNote\": null,\n      \"AwardNoteToSupplier\": null,\n      \"AwardDecisionFlag\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
