          "id": "1767916369016",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767916369018_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your are an advisor that will analize award decision.\n\nThe information about the negotiation responses submitted by supplier including lines details is available here: {{$context.$nodes.NEGOTIATION_RESPONSES_FOR_AWARD.$output}}\n\nThe awarded response payload is: {{$context.$nodes.GENERATE_AWARD_PAYLOAD.$output}}\n\nThe result of the award process: {{$context.$nodes.AWARD_RESPONSE.$output}} \n\nUse a messageListWidget to display the award results. The fist record item will be the award result and then create one record per each line from the awarded response.\n\n\nFor the widget you must generate an actionable insight for ora.Invoke(navigateToNegotiationWorkspace), prioritize will be false and the title will be \"Go to Workspace\", translate it using the language in formating rules. \n\n#Formatting Rules For Output\n -Must Generate the content in {{$context.$variables.Language}} language.\n -Show all monetary amounts in {{$context.$variables.Currency}} currency and format the currency using {{$context.$variables.NumberFormat}} formatting style (for example, symbol placement, decimal separators, etc.).\n -Format all dates using {{$context.$variables.DateFormat}} date format and if there is time you can use this {{$context.$variables.TimeFormat}} time format."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Validate Award Process",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let suggestedAction = $context.$nodes.GET_SUGGESTED_ACTION.$output.result;\n\n\nlet negotiationStatus = $context.$nodes.GET_NEGOTIATION_DATA.$output.NegotiationStatus;\n\nif(negotiationStatus != \"Closed\"){\n    suggestedAction.Action=\"awarded\";\n}\n\nreturn suggestedAction;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767881229548"
          },
          "code": "VALIDATE_AWARD_PROCESS",
